<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings up sharply last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings up sharply last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose sharply to 1,004,205 tonnes in the week to September 17 from a below-average 432,188 tonnes the week before, according the Shetland Islands Council Marine Operations Department.</p>
<p>Just over a third of the loadings, 372,149 tonnes went to U.S. destinations.</p>
<p>Below is a list of loadings:  </p>
