<p>13/9     Stena Concertina	Milford Haven    72,013</p>
<p>	   Sunetta		   Gdansk	     79,235</p>
<p>14/9     Berge Banker	    US Gulf	   282,107</p>
<p>	   Nord Jahre Progress   Portland, Maine  90,042</p>
